window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>Completed series. A Mafia queen. Four dangerous men. And deadly players intent on taking her off the board.</i></b><br> <br> After eight years running a criminal organization, I've got my life and business on track. But when I'm embroiled in a bloody battle for my turf, I also find myself at the center of attention for four smoking hot men.<br> <br> I struggle to get used to them having my back, until I'm crushed under the worst darkness this dangerous world has to offer.<br> <br> Can their love fuel my strength to save myself?<br> <br> This is a dark contemporary Mafia reverse harem romance with triggering situations and dark themes. Includes scenes of BDSM. (Please listen to the preface regarding the triggers.) Scenes of M/M included. Please note that it is set in England with British characters and as such there are British English words used in dialogue and inner monologue.</p>"; 
